msgid "Good work, Kiryu-san. Thank you very much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "I'll continue to do everything I can to help Ibuki-san from this end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Oh, Kotaro found a job somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "We'll miss him, but it's a good thing if he doesn't need us anymore."
msgstr ""

