msgctxt "804"
msgid "Hey, do you have a minute?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "Sure. What is it?"
msgstr "Certo. Cos'è?"

msgctxt "828"
msgid ""
"I've got a hunch the hitman Shu is up on the roof of the Millennium Tower..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Huh!? But it's impossible to hit anybody from way up there, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"I've been thinking the same thing, but I'd still like to check it out just "
"the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "Okay, understood. Whenever you're ready, just let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "To think that Hideki was the hitman Shinzaki all this time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "Kiryu-san, do you know the street musician named Hideki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"He's this young guy who's always singing and playing his guitar in front of "
"the Millennium Tower. He's pretty good, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid ""
"Since he's always there, you might be able to get some good information out "
"of him that'll help you track your targets down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "Contact me whenever you catch one of the hitmen."
msgstr ""

